      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1915.pdf, p.1",
      "values:originalText": "(1.) This Act may be cited as the Crimes Act 1915.\n(2.) The Crimes Act 1914, as amended by this Act, may be cited\nas the Crimes Act 1914-1915.\n(3.) This Act shall continue in force during the continuance of\nthe war and for six months thereafter, and no longer.\nShort title,\ncitation, and\nduration.",
