      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1915.pdf, p.1",
      "values:originalText": "Section eighty-six of the Crimes\nAct 1914 is amended by\ninserting after paragraph (d) the following words:—\n\"or\n(e) to defraud the Commonwealth.\"\nConspiracy to\ndefraud the\nCommonwealth.",
